    <string name="setting_prefer_offline">Prefer on-device transcription</string>
    <string name="setting_prefer_offline_desc">Uses the phone\'s offline speech model when available (Android 12+, language pack must be downloaded in system settings). Keeps audio fully on-device.</string>
    <string name="setting_mute_sounds">Mute recognizer chime while recording</string>
    <string name="setting_mute_sounds_desc">Silences the speech recognizer\'s repeating start/stop chime by muting media, notification, and system sounds during recording (restored when you pause or finish). Turn this off if you need to hear audio from the phone while recording, e.g. a call on speaker.</string>
    <string name="setting_use_llm">Use an LLM for summaries</string>
    <string name="setting_use_llm_desc">Sends the transcript to an OpenAI-compatible endpoint you control — e.g. Ollama on your computer (http://YOUR_PC_IP:11434/v1), Groq, or OpenRouter. When off, a fully offline on-device summarizer is used.</string>
